a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_BloodPotion_Tiefling+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_BloodPotion_Tiefling+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Upon consumption gain each only once until your next <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Recharge Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/1/19/Recharge_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Recharge_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thaumaturgy\" title=\"Thaumaturgy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/25px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/38px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/50px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thaumaturgy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/25px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thaumaturgy\" title=\"Thaumaturgy\">Thaumaturgy</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellish_Rebuke\" title=\"Hellish Rebuke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/25px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/38px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/50px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellish Rebuke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/25px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellish_Rebuke\" title=\"Hellish Rebuke\">Hellish Rebuke</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Hands\" title=\"Burning Hands\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning Hands\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Hands\" title=\"Burning Hands\">Burning Hands</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/25px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/38px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/50px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flame Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/25px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\">Flame Blade</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Fiendish_Vice\"> Condition: Fiendish Vice </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fiendish_Vice_(Condition)\" title=\"Fiendish Vice (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fiendish Vice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fiendish_Vice_(Condition)\" title=\"Fiendish Vice (Condition)\">Fiendish Vice</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity can call on diabolic arcana to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thaumaturgy\" title=\"Thaumaturgy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/25px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/38px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/50px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thaumaturgy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/25px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thaumaturgy\" title=\"Thaumaturgy\">Thaumaturgy</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellish_Rebuke\" title=\"Hellish Rebuke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/25px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/38px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/50px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellish Rebuke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/25px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellish_Rebuke\" title=\"Hellish Rebuke\">Hellish Rebuke</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Hands\" title=\"Burning Hands\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning Hands\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Hands\" title=\"Burning Hands\">Burning Hands</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/25px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/38px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/50px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flame Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/25px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\">Flame Blade</a> once each until the next <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Given by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/38px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/50px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Araj Oblodra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png/25px-Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Portrait_Araj_Oblodra.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Araj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\">Araj Oblodra</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> and later in <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> in exchange for a tiefling's blood\n</p>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Araj's elixirs function independently of other elixirs, stacking with them and each other.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201025\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.085 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.093 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3148/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47546/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11104/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1199749/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   72.815      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   72.815      1 -total\n 42.58%   31.007     12 Template:Icon_text\n 37.73%   27.474     32 Template:Trim\n 18.07%   13.155      7 Template:Icon_link\n 15.40%   11.216      3 Template:Uid\n 14.55%   10.595      1 Template:Condition\n  9.80%    7.135      4 Template:SAI\n  9.42%    6.862      1 Template:Main_only\n  9.07%    6.601      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:15244-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201025 and revision id 396234. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}